{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"flavoured-vulnerable-snowyowl","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context / Problem\n\n`src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira/backend.py:40-53::_fit_description` has no executable consumer; commit `e0eab05b0cceb` moved behavior to `OutboundFieldMapper(AdfCodec(...))`. `adapters/jira/acli_rest.py:115-126::_direct_rest_put` also has no production caller and applies a wrong universal envelope; live calls use `_direct_rest_put_raw`.\n\nThe shared link canonicalizer prerequisite is bacteroid-computable-vole [rebar:bacteroid-computable-vole].\n\n## Approach\n\nAfter the canonicalizer prerequisite, delete both unreachable helpers and stale mock/inventory/comment ownership. Retain mapper/codec sanitizer ordering and raw PUT body/auth/rate-limit/retry behavior.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Jira backend field helper and mapper ownership prose/tests\n- ACLI REST helper, mocks/inventories/comments, and raw-PUT contract tests\n\n## Testing\n\nRun mapper fit/normalization/sanitizer controls and raw PUT endpoint/body/auth/retry tests.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `_fit_description` is removed and maintained prose/tests name `OutboundFieldMapper` plus codec composition as owner.\n- [ ] `_direct_rest_put` is removed with unused mocks, inventories, and stale comments.\n- [ ] `_direct_rest_put_raw` retains exact body, authentication, rate-limit, and retry contracts.\n- [ ] Mapper fit/normalize/sanitizer ordering remains covered.\n- [ ] Focused Jira adapter and raw-PUT suites pass.","id":"79fb-2c91-241c-4a9d","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","priority":2,"tags":["janitor","dead-code","jira","hardening","sdc4"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Remove dead Jira adapter description and PUT helpers"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788315160454796001,"uuid":"9207e1a8-6def-4a96-91c4-89fa7567951a"}